Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: staggered po 10 days

4719
05:15:48,660 --> 05:15:50,160
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: kasi ang normal

4720
05:15:50,160 --> 05:15:52,020
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: and standard na

4721
05:15:52,020 --> 05:15:54,520
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: implementation ng tupad.

4722
